{"id": "25848", "title": "修必罗传奇", "author": "怒涛雪", "category": "侦探推理", "count": 155, "available": 12, "cover": "files/article/image/25/25848/25848s.jpg", "status": "连载中", "source": "files/article/info/25/25848.htm", "intro": "《墓攻》之后，修必罗再披《彼路》历险战甲。这一次，他遇到的究竟是些什么？透天机，大六壬，一条龙，还是不死人的秘密？从西北高原转战江淮水乡，以凌云之气屡克绝世难关。剑如龙，势如虎，修必罗再创继卫斯理之后探险巅峰。\r\n 　　而《刀锋》是修必罗传奇的外传，在这个故事当中，修必罗将要和来自神秘地域的一支邪教组织打一回交道，不过，除了必要的惊悚情节之外，整个故事跟相对离奇的玄幻毫无关系可言。", "base": "files/article/html/25/25848", "chapters": [{"title": "作品相关", "volume": true}, {"title": "引子（1）", "file": "1810596.html", "available": false}, {"title": "英雄所见略同", "file": "1810597.html", "available": false}, {"title": "引子2", "file": "1810598.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第一部 ：墓攻", "volume": true}, {"title": "第一章", "file": "1810600.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第二章", "file": "1810602.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第三章", "file": "1810603.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第四章", "file": "1810604.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第五章", "file": "1810605.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第六章", "file": "1810606.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第七章", "file": "1810607.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第八章", "file": "1810608.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第九章", "file": "1810609.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十章", "file": "1810610.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十一章", "file": "1810611.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十二章", "file": "1810612.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十三章", "file": "1810613.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十四章", "file": "1810614.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十五章", "file": "1810615.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十六章", "file": "1810616.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十七章", "file": "1810617.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十八章", "file": "1810618.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十九章", "file": "1810619.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第二十章", "file": "1810620.html", "available": false}, {"title": "